// Dialog :
"P142551624" "We got ourselves tons of trouble, suga', and it ain't gonna get any better.<br><br>You sit yourself tight right there, I'm gonna see if I can't find out where exactly those members of the Resistance took our little bombs."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Cleopatra 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3778191794" "What's that?<br><br>Bombs in the hospital?! What do they think they're doing? Suga', you gotta be the one to get in there and take care of this! I'll make sure the situation doesn't get outta hand out here.<br><br><color Paragon>Members of the Resistance working undercover for Calvin Scott should inform him of what is happening - before going inside the hospital.</color>."
// Answer Text :
"P2925241926" "I'm on it. (Start Mission)"
// Answer Text :
"P3075141561" "Give me a moment."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CalvinScott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2104180471" "{HeroName}, good to hear from you. What's your current situation? You're working with Cleopatra, right?"
// Answer Text :
"P4182279754" "Right. There's a bombing plot happening at the hospital."
// Answer Text :
"P4149384048" "I am, but I have a question, first. What happened with Monroe?"
// Page MonroeHappening Text :
"P884222558" "Monroe?<br><br>Ah, yes. He's been helping us out a great deal. Some members of his Syndicate have been giving us very important information on the inner workings of Cole's regime.<br><br>I've heard about the trouble you're running into, actually. I may be able to shed some light on it."
// Answer Text :
"P2950448334" "Shed away."
// Page ShedLight Text :
"P4042494926" "Monroe says there's a split in the Syndicate, that the head of the group was <i>killed</i>.<br><br>There is a power struggle going on at this very moment.<br><br>The group that you've been fighting is a group of 'rebel' Syndicate - if you could say that about a group that is centered around organized crime.<br><br>They're seeking to <i>use</i> this cell of the Resistance they found towards their own ends."
// Answer Text :
"P2093784213" "And so the hospital bombing plot was their doing."
// Page SyndicatePlot Text :
"P1141027472" "Exactly. I <i>wish</i> we could claim credit for it - and carry it out - but doing so would not only reveal your cover as a member of the Resistance, but it would also aid a group that seeks to undermine all of the Resistance.<br><br>You'll need to carry out your orders and take down anyone you find in that hospital - especially the Syndicate.<br><br>Just make sure to plant any tracking devices you have on Double Barrel - we'll need it to get him out of the prison he'll be sent to."
// Answer Text :
"P3415841189" "Understood, I'm on it."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2859469403" "Yes, I'm aware of that. Double Barrel is working with some of the Syndicate to set it up.<br><br>You may think it's extreme, but sometimes these things have to be done to move progress <i>forward</i> against Cole's regime."
// Answer Text :
"P2315009757" "Are you out of your mind? Blowing up a hospital is progress?"
// Answer Text :
"P451728258" "So you want me to let them do this?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1353589432" "Out of my mind? No, I'm not out of my mind, {HeroName}, I'm just focused on what has to be done.<br><br>The people need to see that Cole is fallible, that Cole is just a <i>man</i>. A blow to the hospital would show that Cole can't protect the people from everything. But, not today. What's more important is keeping your cover, and your cover involves saving that hospital.<br><br>We need you deep in the Loyalists, {HeroName}, and sometimes that means making sacrifices. When you take down Double Barrel, make sure to plant some tracking bugs on him - that way we can see where they take him and bust him out later on."
// Answer Text :
"P217803398" "Alright, Scott."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P3908183045" "Not today, {HeroName}. It looks like Double Barrel has run into some bad luck on this one. His mission on the hospital is important, but not as important as keeping you as an undercover agent in the Loyalists.<br><br>We'll need you to go in there and take him out to stop the bombing plot. Oh, also, try to plant some tracking devices on him and the soldiers you defeat. It'll help us break them all out of whatever prison the PPD send them to."
// Answer Text :
"P2875453231" "Will do, Scott."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2257560620" "Suga', things are goin' from bad to worse. We got word that the Syndicate already delivered all them bombs to those Crusader boys in the Resistance.<br><br>Now, I got myself a little idea of where they <i>could</i> be in the tunnels, but I ain't givin' you a guarantee that you'll find somethin' down there, suga'. You're gonna have to go down there and destroy any sorta thing that looks like they might be usin' for bombs.<br><br>Also I got word that the gal leadin' the charge goes by the name of Poster Gal. We catch her, we can put a stop to this bombin' plot before it gets started."
// AcceptString :
"P4276769863" "Thanks for the information. I'll make sure to stop this here and now."
// SendOffString :
"P2214646907" "I know you will, suga'. We're gonna make sure that Cole's little hospital won't be getting blown up by those lunatics. I'm one for free speech and all, but blowin' up a hospital just to prove a point? I don't wanna live in a world where those kinds of people are considered the 'good guys'."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3579556138" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Five Minutes to Detonation</color>"

