// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2373299337" "You did good today, {HeroName}. You went and saved all those people in the hospital from certain death. Those Crusader types, they're totally out of their minds.<br><br>You mentioned that a CEO was there, right? I'm gonna be makin' sure that is taken care of. I think we all are underestimatin' the power of the Syndicate, especially if they supposedly have members in high places like this.<br><br>Your work isn't over though, {HeroName}. <color yellow>Chief Interrogator Washington</color> contacted me while you were in the hospital. Looks like he's got himself a lead on where the Resistance is storin' all this information of theirs. You up for one last hurrah?"
// RandomFameString :
"P4012806519" "I saw TPN did a report on how {HeroName} worked with Praetor Sinclair to stop the bombing at Cole Memorial Hospital!"

